meta {
  name: Get All Vehicle
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/vehicle/header
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get All Vehicle

  This request is used to get all vehicle (header format). This request interacts with the MySQL database, has a protected routes, and a pagination.

  ## Responses

  **200 — Vehicle fetched successfully.** Ordered in descending order by `updated_at` and `created_at`
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "vehicle fetched successfully",
    "data": {
      "current_page": 1,
      "data": [
        {
          "id": "2d98f524-de02-11ed-b5ea-0242ac120002",
          "vehicle_name": "Brio RS MT",
          "vehicle_desc": "snowy",
          "vehicle_merk": "Honda",
          "vehicle_type": "City Car",
          "vehicle_transmission": "Manual",
          "vehicle_distance": 45000,
          "vehicle_category": "Personal Car",
          "vehicle_status": "Available",
          "vehicle_plate_number": "D 1610 ZBC",
          "vehicle_fuel_status": "Normal",
          "vehicle_default_fuel": "Shell Super",
          "vehicle_color": "White",
          "vehicle_capacity": 5,
          "vehicle_img_url": null,
          "updated_at": "2025-01-29 15:04:18"
        }
      ],
      "last_page": 1,
      "per_page": 14,
      "total": 1
    }
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — vehicle failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "vehicle not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}